00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:06,000
George of the Jungle is a adventure, comedy,
family film directed by Sam Weisman.

3
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:06,000
Deep in the African jungle, a baby named George, the sole
survivor of a plane crash, is raised by gorillas.

4
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:06,000
George grows up to be a buff and lovable klutz who has a rainforest full of animal friends: Tookie, his big-beaked
toucan messenger; Ape, a witty talking gorilla; and Shep, a peanut-loving pooch of an elephant.

5
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:06,000
But when poachers mess with George's pals, the King of Swing swings into action.

6
00:24:00,000 --> 00:24:06,000
George of the Jungle, played by Brendan Fraser.

7
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:06,000
Ursula Stanhope, played by Leslie Mann.

8
00:32:00,000 --> 00:32:06,000
Lyle Van de Groot, played by Thomas Haden Church.

9
00:36:00,000 --> 00:36:06,000
An Ape Named 'Ape' (voice), played by John Cleese.

10
00:40:00,000 --> 00:40:06,000
Kwame, played by Richard Roundtree.

11
00:44:00,000 --> 00:44:06,000
